        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The monthly amounts outlined in the table below will be used as the balances when the reference is to Transmission Depreciation Reserve for Accounts 351.1, 351.2, 351.3 within Worksheet 2, Lines 15-27 in our formula rate tariff. Consistent with Order No. 898, ITC Great Plains revised its transmission formula rates to continue allocating transmission related computer hardware, software, and communication equipment costs across all transmission projects, as accepted by FERC in Docket No. ER25 300.</span>
