        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:118%">Pursuant to the Settlement Agreement filed and approve by FERC under Docket No. ER09-548-002 and EC11-108-001, the Kansas V-Plan Project Regulatory Asset is amortized monthly straight-line over 10-years beginning April 2015 and the unamortized balance is included in rate base beginning the end of the month of March 2015. The monthly unamortized balance of the Kansas V-Plan Project Regulatory Asset and corresponding 13-month average calculation used in our Formula Rate Tariff is shown below:</span>
